content.text:
I have enough. The Kona Electric has consistently used NMC chemistry (NMC622 for the original 64 kWh; the refreshed 65.4 kWh pack continues NMC family per SK/LG pouch supply). EV-Database confirms 68.5 kWh total / 65.4 kWh usable.

